  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "大约两年前的这个时候，我邀请了几位熟悉的朋友，在雪香斋为握青送行。",
      "output_sha256": "b74720aaa49177e7257ff454a207dff1ba430a8964c594fc92e1edae2664c4d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.588261,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "12c4fe55baf19e7e94d056d1f8c452f331db1cb3b050f150924f8b3e5c8ce6d5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b74720aaa49177e7257ff454a207dff1ba430a8964c594fc92e1edae2664c4d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "雪香斋以绍酒著名。",
      "output_sha256": "68714d92125320a870dc1320583b489a6140ce4a4caef4afe7c66010a32ca348",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "68714d92125320a870dc1320583b489a6140ce4a4caef4afe7c66010a32ca348",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这几个人多半是浙江人，握青也是的，而又有一两个是酒徒，所以便拣了这地方。",
      "output_sha256": "077fa9c534027a60bee2b1f8dff7c15aabc853f0d039a04a539ff77bd2728c73",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "077fa9c534027a60bee2b1f8dff7c15aabc853f0d039a04a539ff77bd2728c73",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说到酒，莲花白太腻，白干太烈；一是北方的佳人，一是关西的大汉，都不宜于浅斟低酌。",
      "output_sha256": "c005969167b75eb6b1a1280071f55ecb8adfc0d3d89cfc98e69797d645e081af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "c005969167b75eb6b1a1280071f55ecb8adfc0d3d89cfc98e69797d645e081af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "只有黄酒，像是温暖的旧书，像是与老朋友的重逢，真是别有一番滋味。",
      "output_sha256": "5f51e0f22c045ddb2acd5630ff48e0652fd2cb51ab8b417c271154e8291466f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.427828,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a0f80d78db47c8364f06103a58afe47aa0a3df8efe2cb59c2c06862553d18c44"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5f51e0f22c045ddb2acd5630ff48e0652fd2cb51ab8b417c271154e8291466f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "雪香斋的酒色泽诱人；如果能喝到“竹叶青”，那就更加美妙了。",
      "output_sha256": "6549e7f9149bb877d3603f5f0d6d90c705ea576925c3cfb3dfeac50996055b7e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.570482,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6b62c80c8354e5d5ddc46c185e6fffb72d8bba5bff3ae77c64348cd7d67dd124"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6549e7f9149bb877d3603f5f0d6d90c705ea576925c3cfb3dfeac50996055b7e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "握青要去美国留学，计划住三年；如此长的别离，大家都有些不舍，那个晚上我们喝了不少酒。",
      "output_sha256": "5ffe1c288f4d24a4ca8c57447e4e8c257d4713834fa88c02cb2bfdfb2d277b40",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.45294,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "22a9b6ca207dd84786329788c6f3549e3bef430d96086e1df7bc6206af3f3a25"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5ffe1c288f4d24a4ca8c57447e4e8c257d4713834fa88c02cb2bfdfb2d277b40",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "告别时，握青又邀请我去中天看电影。",
      "output_sha256": "a9356a337c53c452524bda539f77b64455151b437789d68e02a1e0069656511b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.645,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "64eb230e991b67bf79fb83c1413c8d20119476782928b0f8ead6d842ee1f7b0d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a9356a337c53c452524bda539f77b64455151b437789d68e02a1e0069656511b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我坐下直觉头晕。",
      "output_sha256": "b7049b5fef376a27946af94a633dea7229b6b4ce95750003b19c777807029d79",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "b7049b5fef376a27946af94a633dea7229b6b4ce95750003b19c777807029d79",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "握青说电影如何如何，我只糊糊涂涂听著；几回想张眼看，却什么也看不出。",
      "output_sha256": "de0ff1626e88bbf279b05db0c1e21dea96d1b345cd4b68ea482e8ebd97689cfb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "de0ff1626e88bbf279b05db0c1e21dea96d1b345cd4b68ea482e8ebd97689cfb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "终于支持不住，出其不意，哇地吐出来了。",
      "output_sha256": "f8a7f3ec36c9f6a08597b4fcf7cfa9bc94ade07d7e5cc66db852515f1d3ce605",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "f8a7f3ec36c9f6a08597b4fcf7cfa9bc94ade07d7e5cc66db852515f1d3ce605",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "观众都吃一惊，附近的人全堵上了鼻子；这真有些惶恐。",
      "output_sha256": "ca72c775c74b96e9f3a02687ee4a4c3c52367cb727e6d80a8542f250bdae755c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "ca72c775c74b96e9f3a02687ee4a4c3c52367cb727e6d80a8542f250bdae755c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "握青扶我回到旅馆，他也吐了。",
      "output_sha256": "2c3b20bf214882dbce2b4a9cc67c18a8506e1d97fcbe350955857024c3117fa7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c3b20bf214882dbce2b4a9cc67c18a8506e1d97fcbe350955857024c3117fa7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我们心里都觉得这一晚很痛快。",
      "output_sha256": "bde6fe5f8739dbbe0e03136b7d0f874267af97570e54f2573eb2ba3c5b9d553a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "bde6fe5f8739dbbe0e03136b7d0f874267af97570e54f2573eb2ba3c5b9d553a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想握青该还记得那种狼狈的光景吧？",
      "output_sha256": "2abca9a33428886cc0d5d34592e040c864cbb54b35d75761ec350610f5ef5c68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "2abca9a33428886cc0d5d34592e040c864cbb54b35d75761ec350610f5ef5c68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我与提青的相识是在东南大学。",
      "output_sha256": "e6b5788ea41140c21841ad1b0fdf111b1483fd76c19b9383b8a3f8c888af1782",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.872385,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0af1958c123da7cf0f940f0d5506534a06590380386041aa7dd7c89a839f6a5a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e6b5788ea41140c21841ad1b0fdf111b1483fd76c19b9383b8a3f8c888af1782",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那时正是暑假，中华教育改进社借那儿开会。",
      "output_sha256": "423aac16fc6b3c46400d797242f4f792cc4756649006cfdc50e37a09ce6c82ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "423aac16fc6b3c46400d797242f4f792cc4756649006cfdc50e37a09ce6c82ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我和方兴、寿君去旁听，偶然遇见提青；方君是他的老乡，便为我们介绍。",
      "output_sha256": "bbceba2534463f012aa54596bcaad50be23017a7ab29dd36498238e906e96776",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.680503,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f2e1dd263c2c9247c9643d8f8396fa699d0e59f0ab6da0bc567e55a73fee7481"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bbceba2534463f012aa54596bcaad50be23017a7ab29dd36498238e906e96776",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那时我只知道他很活动，会交际而已。",
      "output_sha256": "8139addf69f3b516e37939d945fe5ee3d0ac639945143501facfd9aec02e6252",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "8139addf69f3b516e37939d945fe5ee3d0ac639945143501facfd9aec02e6252",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "匆匆一面，便未再见。",
      "output_sha256": "b319e325ac86fd7ebe8cc3621d020e326dfc4f7862369197679b767932bd8d59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "b319e325ac86fd7ebe8cc3621d020e326dfc4f7862369197679b767932bd8d59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "三年前，我北来作教，恰好与他同事。",
      "output_sha256": "b70a2e65b2e1accee2470e78730537c49264ef67dbfbaa21b41e015e825892f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "b70a2e65b2e1accee2470e78730537c49264ef67dbfbaa21b41e015e825892f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "初到时，许多事情都不知该如何处理；他给予了我许多帮助。",
      "output_sha256": "5428aaad19baac25abf16c45db7851afdd027a20c01d15f12f538b850d7de04b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.616774,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "deac33a70a5186fe9a714d73087ac7e9c31d5d8b767df6738b99247323aa5fd2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5428aaad19baac25abf16c45db7851afdd027a20c01d15f12f538b850d7de04b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们同住在一个院子里，吃饭也在一处。",
      "output_sha256": "993cf004d3e8b25bd35f4fab035528d8d675fa7616cd064398dd38318d4ed590",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "993cf004d3e8b25bd35f4fab035528d8d675fa7616cd064398dd38318d4ed590",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因此常和他谈论。",
      "output_sha256": "638f9239dc07b185ee6db98264b49053bb5ef112430697094093fc126c239fb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "638f9239dc07b185ee6db98264b49053bb5ef112430697094093fc126c239fb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我渐渐了解到，他不仅仅是个善于交际的人；他有真诚的内心，有敏锐的眼光，还有俊朗的外貌。",
      "output_sha256": "b1398b3156923c62041246ceabd9628ac51812ce8db4f0639f489bb082aa63dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.44339,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ba8ee53862141aa49c5b0283d786a3ecf93707cd8e774aa169555d57018f58d5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b1398b3156923c62041246ceabd9628ac51812ce8db4f0639f489bb082aa63dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "许多朋友都以为他是个傻小子，大家都叫他老魏，连听差背地里也是这样叫他；这个太亲昵的称呼，只有他有。",
      "output_sha256": "572eafb00cd5a51829a2950b82bd1a4060410639d1460ba83ef3fa542640d3f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "572eafb00cd5a51829a2950b82bd1a4060410639d1460ba83ef3fa542640d3f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "但他并不像我们想象的那样“傻”，他是个玩世不恭的人——至少在北京我见到的他是如此。",
      "output_sha256": "34c166e5521c0c0b0ab96139926e208211b86bc685c200053223641613937735",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.699397,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "934b3aa44a045a59bdff5f88a377d4c093de82c61ddafd959510f9a43e9d5191"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "34c166e5521c0c0b0ab96139926e208211b86bc685c200053223641613937735",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那时他曾经历过人生的教训，从前那些严肃的气息暂时隐藏起来，剩下的只是对一切的冷漠态度。",
      "output_sha256": "e278991cfc8331445ad314bb14df665043476150a20408e765a35db1805294b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.557442,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7a4d838caed850057991ab169343db599122d7544ba7fcd746b9632bb8018a9e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e278991cfc8331445ad314bb14df665043476150a20408e765a35db1805294b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们知道这种像刀锋一样的态度，若赤裸裸地暴露出来，便是自我矛盾，因此总得用某种方法掩饰。",
      "output_sha256": "46464a3ee27faf8495eb1d0d59e627769d82474a37d977c73111b5c0d9b26ce1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.608103,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "421e93fd72c57c0531b76247b31f4a8040acd5a8e27366ce3162f07c7409be89"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "46464a3ee27faf8495eb1d0d59e627769d82474a37d977c73111b5c0d9b26ce1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他用的是一副傻子的面具。",
      "output_sha256": "79ba84d339071d9e16c50c4a661646039f3796f84d52f1fd4ee4a28354faab0f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "79ba84d339071d9e16c50c4a661646039f3796f84d52f1fd4ee4a28354faab0f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我有时要揭开他这副面具，他便说我是《语丝》派。",
      "output_sha256": "4351b93f00c5d850bab0c46e17c20958de3cf4736b72a88b3a07ded303c10e18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "4351b93f00c5d850bab0c46e17c20958de3cf4736b72a88b3a07ded303c10e18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但他知道我，并不比我知道他少。",
      "output_sha256": "85727404e005c1e4a48b89cf92e1ba9d561841b759e52ae8baf63c2c2b37445f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "85727404e005c1e4a48b89cf92e1ba9d561841b759e52ae8baf63c2c2b37445f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他能从我一个短语中，洞察全篇的故事。",
      "output_sha256": "dfd29219bb4cb7f6706fecb355fadf1a21e06d9988a1c67bd4b2d7677fe31c93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.695887,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b919665e6e9eaf2914d2c24e256321db04876443bb6a4f3934808a6cac10b4c2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dfd29219bb4cb7f6706fecb355fadf1a21e06d9988a1c67bd4b2d7677fe31c93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他对于别人，也能知道；但只默喻著，不大肯说出。",
      "output_sha256": "15f62f766080e1bbc979c467806f96d283c53b3a0733746bdc7578b798fd57fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "15f62f766080e1bbc979c467806f96d283c53b3a0733746bdc7578b798fd57fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他的玩世，在有些事情上，也许太随便些。",
      "output_sha256": "4e6fb174b6bdefbd2c6be24178b6d5038de25dce7bf0013980a5e0122492556f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "4e6fb174b6bdefbd2c6be24178b6d5038de25dce7bf0013980a5e0122492556f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但以或种意义说，他要复仇；人总是人，又有什么办法呢？",
      "output_sha256": "f033a0c3f495464e7dc5cc2ce1059c18976bf079ac00da5dd40f66a3ca03eebd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "f033a0c3f495464e7dc5cc2ce1059c18976bf079ac00da5dd40f66a3ca03eebd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至少我愿意原谅他。",
      "output_sha256": "14bda44a7b31e41e8fc6ad6b70d4f16430031954d1724a54e394c5dc4c547d90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.6825,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "680f918c8f175443f5818ceb36dfd813c19ca6b074228a2de88996575b2feffa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "14bda44a7b31e41e8fc6ad6b70d4f16430031954d1724a54e394c5dc4c547d90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "以上其实也只说得他的一面；他有时也能为人尽心竭力。",
      "output_sha256": "d94cc16203e2b741b5c33782645e196eb906ea5441fe99d2c2e958193d8a82e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "d94cc16203e2b741b5c33782645e196eb906ea5441fe99d2c2e958193d8a82e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他曾为我主的事。",
      "output_sha256": "2b456f8f7c6ab1a88f06b7e2212ac85c66db397a0f782a6579eda89881931dd3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "2b456f8f7c6ab1a88f06b7e2212ac85c66db397a0f782a6579eda89881931dd3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们沿著墙根，走了不知多少趟；他源源本本，条分缕析地将形势剖解给我听。",
      "output_sha256": "c06300ea48ae8573efdc5028351238e7416d0dfa43c536ae835c9b2870cbfd72",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "c06300ea48ae8573efdc5028351238e7416d0dfa43c536ae835c9b2870cbfd72",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你想，这岂是傻子所能做的？",
      "output_sha256": "4d1d08d133c7c794525dafb7dd845dd931917b4225aab91c2ee2162f397ce525",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "4d1d08d133c7c794525dafb7dd845dd931917b4225aab91c2ee2162f397ce525",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "幸亏有这一面，他还能高高兴兴过日子；不然，没有笑，没有泪，只有冷脸，只有“鬼脸”，岂不郁郁地闷煞人!",
      "output_sha256": "def62ac562e00ff0b1c24dcd8e1788d512f38719e9783520bfbd533c87c84054",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "def62ac562e00ff0b1c24dcd8e1788d512f38719e9783520bfbd533c87c84054",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我最不能忘的，是他动身前不多时的一个月夜。",
      "output_sha256": "ce73647568c11c62fe28040be39b300e8a317207dfecaa6a2b23007c25c03e6b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce73647568c11c62fe28040be39b300e8a317207dfecaa6a2b23007c25c03e6b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "电灯灭后，月光照了满院，柏树森森地竦立著。",
      "output_sha256": "1145009fe95bc77a800c2fec009a641fe856e326089298aa9cc4e81b6b557d68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "1145009fe95bc77a800c2fec009a641fe856e326089298aa9cc4e81b6b557d68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "屋内人都睡了；我们站在月光里，柏树旁，看著自己的影子。",
      "output_sha256": "4988fad2044f3a9274703096d5239b881fb7a4eaa7a595931d7d1d9beb7e986c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "4988fad2044f3a9274703096d5239b881fb7a4eaa7a595931d7d1d9beb7e986c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他轻声讲述着自己生平的冒险故事，时而讲述，时而沉默。",
      "output_sha256": "4afd08f8a34501f27232309916cf0369d2b66c4fbf05eb2d8c4785e5d7d5eeeb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.425985,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46,
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b694a1916d7670030782268d612056e4e6804f146dc7f6cbee7cb46441b15555",
        "c87dba3c78cb64796777ff19e1608c31c7df44ef19561ee6e790852bad01eb32"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4afd08f8a34501f27232309916cf0369d2b66c4fbf05eb2d8c4785e5d7d5eeeb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是一个的奇的境界。",
      "output_sha256": "d601fec8e34fc8b1bf3c9f985666577dcf92fb1f632eac1912379c32372edc23",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "d601fec8e34fc8b1bf3c9f985666577dcf92fb1f632eac1912379c32372edc23",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "叙述时，他脸上透着淡淡的微笑，这正是他内心平静时常显露的表情；一边微微侧头，仿佛在询问。",
      "output_sha256": "6e1a480752d021c0f4c2fdca52329ef244b033125a9ce55fd9cab16282759da6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.448432,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "96df9bc58239e4a7f11649966f0bfdee5630aadc4eb7b433881a4f8ad5aa8d9e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6e1a480752d021c0f4c2fdca52329ef244b033125a9ce55fd9cab16282759da6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这种光，这种院子，这种柏树，这种谈话，都很可珍贵；就由握青自己再来一次，怕也不一样的。",
      "output_sha256": "cc7e02757db0413b560877a0c8ca61cc75ab54d962d6ea248153d8f990baf894",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "cc7e02757db0413b560877a0c8ca61cc75ab54d962d6ea248153d8f990baf894",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他离开前，很希望我为他写一些文字；但又以玩世不恭的态度说道：“你不会愿意吧？",
      "output_sha256": "ae32878414be77bf104bf73774fe0e6bf18e26c50cf48dec63d47202a3086d12",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.490877,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51,
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d03a1d9b1c19ff35b856e1c565ac27a3b49ffc6f834edf50d43d9a4f6d06206",
        "de89ecf0144fd1566c53e10b1e863144fe049f0b35f743cd31451f1b6dc728d5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ae32878414be77bf104bf73774fe0e6bf18e26c50cf48dec63d47202a3086d12",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我知道，你是不肯的。”",
      "output_sha256": "2c4e81237375bc893b285d4310d28eae695537c7e9991c08667fca80c59ec5e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.554545,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e17a42f278aa389de50294424e8aed26077b8ddc362234aa64260df61186425b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2c4e81237375bc893b285d4310d28eae695537c7e9991c08667fca80c59ec5e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我说，“一定做，而且一定写成一幅横披——只是字不行些。”",
      "output_sha256": "6d7f9fcbc23c26f983be96a89ff3fb38f5b03f5950d051eeff6b4769cf146eb3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d7f9fcbc23c26f983be96a89ff3fb38f5b03f5950d051eeff6b4769cf146eb3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "但是我为自己的懒惰而感到羞愧，那“一定”早已几乎变成了“不肯”！",
      "output_sha256": "f266d7b575921445f0e4cf60180d31fb50e33073e5237cb99fe1496a306dcbb4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.60439,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6182093eda4c386f70340d40bcbd8ab60387d6b9094881d6d08737bb099577c8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f266d7b575921445f0e4cf60180d31fb50e33073e5237cb99fe1496a306dcbb4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而且他来了两封信，我竟未覆只字。",
      "output_sha256": "c5f9559af28a6d6f69fe071d8863781ef8838faa71b574791193a5d28d791a26",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "c5f9559af28a6d6f69fe071d8863781ef8838faa71b574791193a5d28d791a26",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这叫我怎样说好呢？",
      "output_sha256": "7eb8e61f5ae6af3177dccd01a15c7a8feed4b035ffafc55647966ee3503b8220",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "7eb8e61f5ae6af3177dccd01a15c7a8feed4b035ffafc55647966ee3503b8220",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我实在有种坏脾气，觉得路太遥远，竟有些渺茫一般，什么便都因循下来了。",
      "output_sha256": "bf1faf57456d1597cfff6467596e131c70453d61cbb35bf18e64512b51535d1e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "bf1faf57456d1597cfff6467596e131c70453d61cbb35bf18e64512b51535d1e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好在他的成绩很好，我是知道的；只此就很够了。",
      "output_sha256": "04ca14e0ba0b99e946ec7f5c621cf08f87979be7a1b6399e0e89f7e10352eb6b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "04ca14e0ba0b99e946ec7f5c621cf08f87979be7a1b6399e0e89f7e10352eb6b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其他的，反正他明年就会回来，我们再好好聊几次，这是最重要的。",
      "output_sha256": "073b0bd164bd62d60909f88af906d4f3ffbdb81115c9fdc8376b6c6b552e6cbe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.705979,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a2fcffbd9f508108a4205e3267494348b483242cdec0db9f4b0fcfca8c8fcedc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "073b0bd164bd62d60909f88af906d4f3ffbdb81115c9fdc8376b6c6b552e6cbe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "——我想，握青也许不那么玩世了吧。",
      "output_sha256": "777de0c19e839275d63e21ef5d7b5bd9eff3be4ba96af9c9d37c512d7e0945f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "777de0c19e839275d63e21ef5d7b5bd9eff3be4ba96af9c9d37c512d7e0945f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
